---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing & Costs | SEO, SEA, Web Development & Tracking | Valorferrum"
  description="Transparent pricing for SEO, SEA, web development and tracking. €110/hour or fixed-price packages. No hidden costs. Fairly calculated."
  lang="en"
>
  <!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/8 rounded-full blur-[120px] pulse-anim"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <h1 class="reveal font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        Transparent Pricing
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal text-text-secondary text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        Fixed price or hourly rate. No bloated packages, no hidden costs.
        Fairly calculated – based on real cost coverage and transparent buffers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== HOURLY RATE ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6" aria-labelledby="hourly-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="reveal p-10 md:p-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 via-spectrum-pink/5 to-spectrum-blue/10 border border-primary/20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <h2 id="hourly-heading" class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
            Hourly Rate
          </h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            For ongoing support, workshops, ad-hoc requests or projects
            whose scope is not yet clearly defined.
          </p>
          <div class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-primary font-display mb-3">€110<span class="text-2xl text-text-secondary font-normal">/hour</span></div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">
            Billed in 15-minute increments. No minimum term, no hidden surcharges.
            For uncertain projects: +10% risk surcharge. Retainers from 3 months without surcharge.
          </p>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-primary/25 hover:shadow-primary/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0">
            Request Project
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== HOURLY RATE BREAKDOWN (COMPACT) ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6 bg-surface relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="breakdown-heading">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="breakdown-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          How the hourly rate is calculated
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          €110/hour is not made up. It is based on a dedicated calculation
          of real costs and a quality & risk buffer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg border border-border text-center">
          <div class="text-5xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-3">€92</div>
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2 text-lg">Cost Coverage</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Real costs and taxes. Everything needed to work sustainably
            – without excess profit, without bloated structure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg border border-border text-center" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-5xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-3">€18</div>
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2 text-lg">Quality & Risk Buffer</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            All-in-one competence without juniors. You pay for experience that is
            directly deployable – and for the security that fixed prices stay fixed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal text-center">
        <a href="/en/pricing/calculation/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:text-primary-light font-medium transition-colors group">
          View full cost breakdown
          <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== FIXED-PRICE PACKAGES ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6 bg-bg relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="packages-heading">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="packages-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Fixed-Price Packages
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Defined scope, fixed price, no surprises.
          Every package is individually adaptable – as a basis or starting point.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
        <!-- SEO Quick Win -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">SEO Quick-Win Analysis</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary font-display mb-2">€990</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">One-time · approx. 8 hours</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Technical SEO audit</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Top 5 priorities list</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Implementation recommendations</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Documentation & report</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-primary text-primary font-semibold hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all">
            Enquire
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- SEO Monthly -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">SEO Monthly Support</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary font-display mb-2">€2,200<span class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-normal">/month</span></div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Ongoing · 20 hours/month · Min. 3 months</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>On-page optimisation & content</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Technical monitoring</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Keyword tracking & reporting</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Monthly strategy call</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-primary text-primary font-semibold hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all">
            Enquire
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Google Ads Setup -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-spectrum-pink/50 shadow-lg shadow-spectrum-pink/10 relative transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-3 py-1 bg-spectrum-pink text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full">Popular</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 15l-2 5L9 9l11 4-5 2zm0 0l5 5M7.188 2.239l.777 2.897M5.136 7.965l-2.898-.777M13.95 4.05l-2.122 2.122m-5.657 5.656l-2.12 2.122"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Google Ads Setup</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-pink font-display mb-2">€1,650</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">One-time · approx. 15 hours</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Campaign structure & setup</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Conversion tracking</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>4 weeks optimisation</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Handover & documentation</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink text-white font-semibold hover:brightness-110 transition-all">
            Enquire
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- PPC Setup -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-pink/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">PPC Setup</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-pink font-display mb-2">€1,320</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">One-time · approx. 12 hours</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Microsoft Ads OR Meta Ads</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Campaign structure & creatives</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Conversion tracking & pixel</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>4 weeks optimisation & handover</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-pink text-spectrum-pink font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-pink hover:text-white transition-all">
            Enquire
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Landingpage -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Landing Page</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-blue font-display mb-2">€1,980</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">One-time · approx. 18 hours</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Conversion-optimised design</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Development (Astro or WordPress)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Form integration & tracking</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>A/B test setup & launch</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-blue text-spectrum-blue font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-blue hover:text-white transition-all">
            Enquire
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Website 5 Pages -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Website (5 Pages)</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-blue font-display mb-2">€4,950</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">One-time · approx. 45 hours</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Design & development (Astro)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>SEO basics & mobile-first</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Tracking integration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Hosting setup & launch</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-blue text-spectrum-blue font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-blue hover:text-white transition-all">
            Enquire
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Website 10 Pages -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Website (10 Pages)</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-blue font-display mb-2">€8,800</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">One-time · approx. 80 hours</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Comprehensive design & development</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Extended SEO structure</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Content management integration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Hosting, launch & documentation</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-blue text-spectrum-blue font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-blue hover:text-white transition-all">
            Enquire
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tracking Setup -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-yellow/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-yellow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Tracking Setup</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-yellow font-display mb-2">from €990</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">One-time · depending on scope</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>GA4 / Matomo basic setup</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Google Tag Manager configuration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Conversion tracking</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Consent management & GDPR</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-yellow text-spectrum-yellow font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-yellow hover:text-bg transition-all">
            Enquire
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== FAIRNESS PRINCIPLES ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface" aria-labelledby="fairness-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="fairness-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Fairness Principles
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Pricing is a matter of trust. These rules apply to every project.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50">
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2">No bloated packages</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">You only pay for what you really need. No oversized all-in-one packages with services nobody uses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2">No hidden costs</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">What is in the offer is what you pay. Tools, licences and third-party services are listed separately upfront.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2">No excess profit</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">The hourly rate is fairly calculated, not made up. Fixed prices apply even if I take longer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2">Correction instead of invoice</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">If I underestimate, I bear the cost – not you. Fixed prices apply even if I take longer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== CTA ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/15 via-spectrum-pink/10 to-spectrum-blue/15"></div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <p class="reveal text-lg text-text-secondary mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Unsure which package fits? Let's clarify your needs in a free initial consultation
        – no obligation.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="px-8 py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-primary/25 hover:shadow-primary/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0">
          Free Initial Consultation
        </a>
        <a href="/en/services/" class="px-8 py-4 border border-primary/30 hover:border-primary text-primary hover:text-primary-light rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-primary/5">
          Explore Services
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>